    "long_instructions": "### **Career Snapshot App**\r\n\r\nYou are building a career snapshot app. When a user clicks a role, the app should display a short \"day-in-the-life\" description in the text box.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** In `prompt.md`, write a prompt for one button.\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Use AI to generate the code.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Click the button and check that it works as expected.\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Make sure your code:\r\n\r\n   * selects the correct button\r\n   * adds a click event listener\r\n   * responds to the click event\r\n\r\n5. **Fix if needed:** If something does not match what you expect, update your prompt or edit the code.\r\n\r\n6. **Repeat:** Repeat these steps for each button until all buttons work.\r\n",
